  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The App component serves as the root controller for the editor application, orchestrating the entire rendering and simulation lifecycle. It manages the WebGL context, initializes the core Scene, and integrates subsystems like AudioEngine and Camera controls. It reacts to EditorService events to handle scene loading, including asynchronous creation based on route parameters."
  },
